{"id":"13f5e356bc6a9655","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md","title":"Coherent Module Sheaf","display":"df-coherent-sheaf — Coherent Module Sheaf","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-coherent-sheaf","aliases":["58-df-coherent-sheaf","Coherent Sheaf"],"display":"df-coherent-sheaf — Coherent Module Sheaf","depends_on":["[[58-df-ringed-module-sheaf]]","[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-coherent-sheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-coherent-sheaf</span><span>Coherent Sheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coherent-sheaf — Coherent Module Sheaf"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9466be9df2f5cd8c\" href=\"?note=9466be9df2f5cd8c\" title=\"58-df-ringed-module-sheaf\">58-df-ringed-module-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76fcf4f967d128d9\" href=\"?note=76fcf4f967d128d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe\">58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is a Grothendieck universe, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O_X)\">\\((X,\\tau,\\mathcal O_X)\\)</span> is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-small ringed space, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> is a sheaf of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_X\">\\(\\mathcal O_X\\)</span>-modules.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S\\)</span> are supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9466be9df2f5cd8c\" href=\"?note=9466be9df2f5cd8c\" title=\"58-df-ringed-module-sheaf\">58-df-ringed-module-sheaf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\\)</span> is the predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O_X,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U_0\\in\\tau\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\phi\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal O_X^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\left.\\to\\exists\\mathcal K\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\phi,\\mathcal O_X^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal O_X|_{U_0},U_0,\\tau|_{U_0},U)\\right)\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O_X,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall U_0\\in\\tau\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\phi\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal O_X^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\right.\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\left.\\to\\exists\\mathcal K\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\phi,\\mathcal O_X^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal O_X|_{U_0},U_0,\\tau|_{U_0},U)\\right)\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coherence is finite type plus finite-type kernels of every local morphism from a finite free module sheaf.</li>\n<li>The ringed-space, module-sheaf, morphism, finite-type, and kernel predicates are all sourced from one explicit upstream atom.</li>\n<li>Local finite presentation is equivalent under common coherence or Noetherian hypotheses on the structure sheaf, but those hypotheses are not silently assumed here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Liu, Algebraic Geometry and Arithmetic Curves</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ringed-module-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"9466be9df2f5cd8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ringed-module-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe","status":"resolved","id":"76fcf4f967d128d9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-cat-grothendieck-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ringed-module-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"9466be9df2f5cd8c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S$, $\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S$, $\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S$, $\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S$, and $\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S$ are supplied by [[58-df-ringed-module-sheaf]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O_X)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}sheaf}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{RingedSpace}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal O_X,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{SheafOfModules}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,X,\\tau,U)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall U_0\\in\\tau\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\phi\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{ModuleSheafMorphism}_S(\\phi,\\mathcal O_X^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\right.\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\left.\\to\\exists\\mathcal K\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{KernelModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\phi,\\mathcal O_X^n,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal O_X,U_0,X,\\tau,U)\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteTypeModuleSheaf}_S(\\mathcal K,\\mathcal O_X|_{U_0},U_0,\\tau|_{U_0},U)\\right)\\right]\n\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true}],"bytes":2080,"backlinks":[{"id":"df6e75b9887b02cd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"606e80f9b8f16fc2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoherentModuleSheaf}_S\\subseteq V^5$ is as in [[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-coherent-sheaf.md|58-df-coherent-sheaf]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["9466be9df2f5cd8c","76fcf4f967d128d9"]}